{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o015e","title":"乐进从攻黎阳斩严敬平乐安","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o015e-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"乐进从攻黎阳斩严敬平乐安","evidence":["zhangle-e-o015e-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0236","role":"攻战","evidence":["zhangle-e-o015e-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0014","role":"被斩","evidence":["zhangle-e-o015e-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"乐进从曹操征伐时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o015e-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o015e-q","source_order":[17,57,"O015e"],"order":3508}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0014","name":"严敬","evidence":["zhangle-q-o015"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o015-zhangle-p0014","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o015"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o015e-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-ed66dc626c10ce5c9c00","layer":"original","quote":"从击谭、尚于黎阳，斩其大将严敬，行游击将军〖5〗。别击黄巾，破之，定乐安郡。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":165,"end":203},{"id":"zhangle-q-o015","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-ed66dc626c10ce5c9c00","layer":"original","quote":"乐进字文谦，阳平卫国人也〖1〗。容貌短小，以胆烈从太祖，为帐下吏。遣还本郡募兵，得千余人；还为军假司马、陷阵都尉〖2〗。从击吕布于濮阳，张超于雍丘，桥蕤于苦；皆先登有功，封广昌亭侯。从征张绣于安众；围吕布于下邳，破别将。击眭固于射犬，攻刘备于沛；皆破之，拜讨寇校尉〖3〗。渡河攻获嘉〖4〗。还，从击袁绍于官渡；力战，斩绍将淳于琼。从击谭、尚于黎阳，斩其大将严敬，行游击将军〖5〗。别击黄巾，破之，定乐安郡。从围邺。邺定，从击袁谭于南皮；先登，入谭东门。谭败，别攻雍奴，破之。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":237}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
